OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after man, 18, stabbed in
OL,4,Alate-night attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn man has been seriously injured after
OL,7,Fa stabbing in Greater Manchester.
OL,9,FPolice were called to Market Street,
OL,10,FBury, at 12:52 GMT where an 18-year-old
OL,11,Fvictim was found with serious injuries.
OL,13,FAnother 18-year-old man was arrested at
OL,14,Fthe scene and remains in custody for
OL,15,Fquestioning. Greater Manchester Police
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FEnquiries are ongoing, the force said.
